{"3426510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LATITUDE OF THE CULT", "steam_appid": 3426510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latitude of the Cult</strong> is a psychological horror adventure presented primarily in <strong>third-person</strong>, with select <strong>first-person sequences</strong> used for heightened immersion and specific gameplay moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore unsettling environments, uncover narrative clues, and progress through a combination of <strong>exploration, traversal, stealth, combat, and environmental puzzles</strong>. The game blends atmospheric tension with moments of action, allowing players to adapt their approach to different situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat includes <strong>shooting and melee encounters</strong>, complemented by <strong>stealth mechanics</strong> that reward patience and observation. Traversal systems such as <strong>climbing and driving</strong> are used to navigate varied locations and reach new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is structured into chapters, with choices and player actions influencing how events unfold and how the story is interpreted.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latitude of the Cult</strong> is a psychological horror adventure presented primarily in <strong>third-person</strong>, with select <strong>first-person sequences</strong> used for heightened immersion and specific gameplay moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore unsettling environments, uncover narrative clues, and progress through a combination of <strong>exploration, traversal, stealth, combat, and environmental puzzles</strong>. The game blends atmospheric tension with moments of action, allowing players to adapt their approach to different situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat includes <strong>shooting and melee encounters</strong>, complemented by <strong>stealth mechanics</strong> that reward patience and observation. Traversal systems such as <strong>climbing and driving</strong> are used to navigate varied locations and reach new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is structured into chapters, with choices and player actions influencing how events unfold and how the story is interpreted.</p>", "short_description": "Latitude of the Cult blends psychological horror with stealth, combat, and exploration. Face fanatics and unpredictable threats as you fight, hide, and survive across hostile environments where tension, choice, and atmosphere shape every encounter and the reality around you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426510/cd95a3903cc1eba05c1e1b8d10916d366cd2a4b5/header.jpg?t=1788204760", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426510/5cb2be60ff562286b61db03f369d3da8e31296f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788204760", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426510/5cb2be60ff562286b61db03f369d3da8e31296f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788204760", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cl